# Git repo of our DTA mods, in place in the game folder. Everything is ignored (DTA's own files, saves, logs, client
# settings), except the repo files, Modding/ and the game files that Modding/tools/dta-capture.ps1 lists in the generated
# block below (our new files + the DTA files we changed). Patched binaries (game.exe, Vinifera.dll) are rebuilt by scripts.
# Wiki: Modding/wiki/workflow/repo-and-updates.md
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/Modding/

# Modding: local only (binary cache, zips duplicating the archive folders, probe logs)
/Modding/.dta-cache/
/Modding/archive/*.zip
/Modding/tools/*.log

# >>> dta-capture: generated by Modding/tools/dta-capture.ps1 (do not edit; change Modding/dta/sync.json instead)
!/INI/
/INI/*
!/INI/Art.ini
!/INI/BattleE.ini
!/INI/Game Options/
/INI/Game Options/*
!/INI/Game Options/StarCraft.ini
!/INI/Game Options/Super Mod.ini
!/INI/Map Code/
/INI/Map Code/*
!/INI/Map Code/Terran Faction.ini
!/INI/MPMaps.ini
!/INI/Rules.ini
!/INI/Sound.ini
!/Maps/
/Maps/*
!/Maps/Custom/
/Maps/Custom/*
!/Maps/Custom/arka00_gibraltar.map
!/Maps/Custom/arka00_gibraltar.png
!/Maps/Custom/arka01_marsara.map
